abstract: >-
  Interactive street-network maps of the Newcastle Urban Observatory
  sensor network, one per year from 2013 to 2026. Each map shows the
  OpenStreetMap street graph and the sensor locations for that year,
  generated by the public Kaggle notebook from the public dataset.
